      "widgets_values": [
        "For the target video, at 0.00 seconds into the target video, <Picture 1> (from [Shot 1]) is fully referenced.\n\nintegrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action, cinematic, the young woman in <Picture 1> keeps her seat on the floral sofa in front of the freestanding peeling wall and its empty gold frame, preserving her black chin-length bob with a blunt fringe in the same length and shape throughout, the white turtleneck, the long black coat, the paved ground and the square medium-wide framing. The low sun sits over the sea at the left and throws her shadow onto the plaster behind her. The camera pushes in with small amplitude at slow speed as the light turns from pale pink to amber, her shadow slides and thins across the wall, a light breeze moves only a few loose strands at her temple, and the empty frame rocks once on its nail. She lifts her chin, holds the lens, and exhales.\n\noverall_soundscape: Steady sea wash and a light wind across an open shoreline, with the faint creak of the hanging frame and the soft rustle of wool.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A",
