      "title": "Note: MiniMax H3 Latent Upscale",
      "properties": {},
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000",
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Latent Upscale: MiniMax H3\n\n**Input Assets**\n- [h3_latent_upscale_startframe.png](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/refs/heads/main/input/h3_latent_upscale_startframe.png) — required workflow input (`input/h3_latent_upscale_startframe.png`)\n\nShot at 992x992, enlarged in latent space, then a second half-schedule pass puts detail back. Decoded once, at the final size.\n\n1. **Image to Video** — `992x992`, `length` 124 (5 s @ 24 fps, H3's 17k+5 grid). Pass 2 needs a second conditioning at 1536x1536: a low-res keyframe cannot sit on the larger token grid.\n2. **Low-res pass** — 8-step turbo LoRA, `simple`, `res_multistep`.\n3. **Latent Upscale** — to 1536x1536; audio passes through untouched.\n4. **Refine pass** — 8 steps split at 4, only the low-sigma half runs.\n5. **Save Video** — 24 fps, muxes the audio track.\n\nBoth passes share sampler and guider; only sigmas differ. Sizes stay multiples of 32."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Latent Upscale: MiniMax H3\n\n**Input Assets**\n- [h3_latent_upscale_startframe.png](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/refs/heads/main/input/h3_latent_upscale_startframe.png) — required workflow input (`input/h3_latent_upscale_startframe.png`)\n\nShot at 992x992, enlarged in latent space, then a second half-schedule pass puts detail back. Decoded once, at the final size.\n\n1. **Image to Video** — `992x992`, `length` 124 (5 s @ 24 fps, H3's 17k+5 grid). Pass 2 needs a second conditioning at 1536x1536: a low-res keyframe cannot sit on the larger token grid.\n2. **Low-res pass** — 8-step turbo LoRA, `simple`, `res_multistep`.\n3. **Latent Upscale** — to 1536x1536; audio passes through untouched.\n4. **Refine pass** — 8 steps split at 4, only the low-sigma half runs.\n5. **Save Video** — 24 fps, muxes the audio track.\n\nBoth passes share sampler and guider; only sigmas differ. Sizes stay multiples of 32."
      }
    },
